(2653789, 368188, 34938, '<td valign="top">when I saw the thumbnait I thought I would love this and of course, seeing it on the scree, I do...amazing photography, stunning beauty and a wonderful idea...I cannot fault this, except to say that her nose looks a little hard pressed against the mirror, but I have to give this a 10 and hope it gets the blue ribbon...my favourite in this challenge</td>', 'when I saw the thumbnait I thought I would love this and of course, seeing it on the scree, I do...amazing photography, stunning beauty and a wonderful idea...I cannot fault this, except to say that her nose looks a little hard pressed against the mirror, but I have to give this a 10 and hope it gets the blue ribbon...my favourite in this challenge', '2006-07-24 04:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2653797, 367791, 49326, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. The lighting is very good though it''s taken outdoors. The subject is interesting.</td>', 'I love the composition. The lighting is very good though it''s taken outdoors. The subject is interesting.', '2006-07-24 04:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2653798, 368380, 34938, '<td valign="top">I want to be really positive about this shot, because you have one stunning woman and technically, a fantastci shot with great lighting and nice composition...my only problem is the ''why'' factor...I don''t get it...maybe I am slow...<br/> <br/>I still love the shot and congratulate you for the effort and time...<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I want to be really positive about this shot, because you have one stunning woman and technically, a fantastci shot with great lighting and nice composition...my only problem is the ''why'' factor...I don''t get it...maybe I am slow... I still love the shot and congratulate you for the effort and time... 8', '2006-07-24 04:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
