(2654345, 368380, 59891, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but as artistic and golden as those stitches are, for me they distract from an otherwise stunning portrait.  Is there a message here?  Outside of the stitches - the lighting is wonderful and the gold powder/coloring is nicely subtle.  The model is lovely with fabulous skin and eyes.  I''m not sure about all the empty space on the right.</td>', 'Sorry, but as artistic and golden as those stitches are, for me they distract from an otherwise stunning portrait.  Is there a message here?  Outside of the stitches - the lighting is wonderful and the gold powder/coloring is nicely subtle.  The model is lovely with fabulous skin and eyes.  I''m not sure about all the empty space on the right.', '2006-07-24 10:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654355, 368328, 49315, '<td valign="top">Where have I seen that church before...</td>', 'Where have I seen that church before...', '2006-07-24 10:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
