(2654427, 368644, 118503, '<td valign="top">i dont get it.  A leaft with gold prongs....interesting.  Hmm...  Still thinking.  Umm....no.</td>', 'i dont get it.  A leaft with gold prongs....interesting.  Hmm...  Still thinking.  Umm....no.', '2006-07-24 10:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
