(2654517, 367466, 19982, '<td valign="top">There''s some color banding going on here (watch the colors as they circle outward towards the edges).  Most likely the image is shot in jpeg mode and then individual colors (rather than all colors) were boosted in a hue/sat layer (or equivalent).  <br/> <br/>Ways to fight banding:  1) Shoot in raw, edit in 16-bit mode, 2) boost all colors (or at least adjacent colors, e.g. both blue &amp; cyan together), 3) don''t boost the color so much, 4) sometimes NeatImage (or equivalent) can cause it, so watch the color output, 5) sometimes reducing the image size for web can cause it (best bet is PhotoShop''s "Save for Web").<br/> <br/>Hope the tips help...</td>', 'There''s some color banding going on here (watch the colors as they circle outward towards the edges).  Most likely the image is shot in jpeg mode and then individual colors (rather than all colors) were boosted in a hue/sat layer (or equivalent).   Ways to fight banding:  1) Shoot in raw, edit in 16-bit mode, 2) boost all colors (or at least adjacent colors, e.g. both blue & cyan together), 3) don''t boost the color so much, 4) sometimes NeatImage (or equivalent) can cause it, so watch the color output, 5) sometimes reducing the image size for web can cause it (best bet is PhotoShop''s "Save for Web"). Hope the tips help...', '2006-07-24 11:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654524, 366777, 14671, '<td valign="top">While beauty is in the eye of the beholder and your model is beautiful I don''t think this fits the challenge all to well as there is nothing "gold" about her.</td>', 'While beauty is in the eye of the beholder and your model is beautiful I don''t think this fits the challenge all to well as there is nothing "gold" about her.', '2006-07-24 11:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654533, 368471, 14671, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t a photo I''d hang on my wall it does fit the challenge.  I don''t like the shadow of the hand but would have prefered to have it a little less bright.  Diming the brightness should also add a little more contrast to the photo and would have given you better highlights.  The hotspot on the banana is a little distracting as well. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'While this isn''t a photo I''d hang on my wall it does fit the challenge.  I don''t like the shadow of the hand but would have prefered to have it a little less bright.  Diming the brightness should also add a little more contrast to the photo and would have given you better highlights.  The hotspot on the banana is a little distracting as well. <5>', '2006-07-24 11:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654536, 368596, 14671, '<td valign="top">Not a photo I''d hang on my wall and in my opinion doesn''t fit the challenge very well.</td>', 'Not a photo I''d hang on my wall and in my opinion doesn''t fit the challenge very well.', '2006-07-24 11:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654539, 368246, 14671, '<td valign="top">An artisti aproach to this challenge and fits very well.  Excellent crispness and clarity and a harmonious balance between brightness and contrast.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'An artisti aproach to this challenge and fits very well.  Excellent crispness and clarity and a harmonious balance between brightness and contrast.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <9>', '2006-07-24 11:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654551, 368153, 62006, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Would love to see the details.</td>', 'Out of focus. Would love to see the details.', '2006-07-24 11:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654557, 368629, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''d would have like to see the title refer to the song.  ie "Ray a drop of golden sun..."  I do like the shot as a whole and the silhouette is very well done and the colors are outstanding.  The horizon is straight which is nice to see for one as I find most people don''t take the time to look and have them tilted.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I''d would have like to see the title refer to the song.  ie "Ray a drop of golden sun..."  I do like the shot as a whole and the silhouette is very well done and the colors are outstanding.  The horizon is straight which is nice to see for one as I find most people don''t take the time to look and have them tilted.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2006-07-24 11:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654563, 368652, 37719, '<td valign="top">What does the height have to do with the photograph?  Not necessary.</td>', 'What does the height have to do with the photograph?  Not necessary.', '2006-07-24 11:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654569, 365519, 14671, '<td valign="top">While this certainly fits the challenge well it is not a shot I''d hang on my wall.  Perhaps a little dodgin/burning to add some darker highlights to the photo and make the subject really stand out more.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt; first vote and up''d to &lt;6&gt; for excellent clarity</td>', 'While this certainly fits the challenge well it is not a shot I''d hang on my wall.  Perhaps a little dodgin/burning to add some darker highlights to the photo and make the subject really stand out more.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5> first vote and up''d to <6> for excellent clarity', '2006-07-24 11:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654575, 367802, 62009, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really distracting in this.</td>', 'The lighting is really distracting in this.', '2006-07-24 11:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2654579, 367790, 14671, '<td valign="top">While I''m not fond of the car its not the car I''m voting on.  Great clarity and nicely blurred background and great comp.  A shot I''d expect to see on a billboard etc.  It also fits the challenge well.  The shot however is a little to simple for me and has a quiet feeling about it.  I really like the way the car appears to be looking you right in the face or almost oncoming feeling.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'While I''m not fond of the car its not the car I''m voting on.  Great clarity and nicely blurred background and great comp.  A shot I''d expect to see on a billboard etc.  It also fits the challenge well.  The shot however is a little to simple for me and has a quiet feeling about it.  I really like the way the car appears to be looking you right in the face or almost oncoming feeling.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2006-07-24 11:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
