(2655495, 366813, 50034, '<td valign="top">Hope you don''t get graded too harshly for your subject, but I think that''s actually brass instead of gold.  It is a very nice photo none-the-less.</td>', 'Hope you don''t get graded too harshly for your subject, but I think that''s actually brass instead of gold.  It is a very nice photo none-the-less.', '2006-07-24 15:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
