(2655514, 368257, 16004, '<td valign="top">naturally, the croplets of water does make it a little cliched, but damn it, it adds so much to the shot!  it''s very nice, the lighting is beautifully done, and overall very nice.  i thought the crop is a bit narrow, with possibly a bit too much black at the top, but that''s a really minor niggle.  it''s a beautiful shot, and would be a good starting point for a similarly themed series... 9.</td>', 'naturally, the croplets of water does make it a little cliched, but damn it, it adds so much to the shot!  it''s very nice, the lighting is beautifully done, and overall very nice.  i thought the crop is a bit narrow, with possibly a bit too much black at the top, but that''s a really minor niggle.  it''s a beautiful shot, and would be a good starting point for a similarly themed series... 9.', '2006-07-24 15:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
