(2655987, 366074, 60862, '<td valign="top">The tall crop pulled my eye into the dark area in the middle, esp. with the lighter part at the top.  Wonder what it''d look like with that part cropped out?</td>', 'The tall crop pulled my eye into the dark area in the middle, esp. with the lighter part at the top.  Wonder what it''d look like with that part cropped out?', '2006-07-24 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
