(2655991, 368380, 4967, '<td valign="top">very weird!  I like your use of blank space.  I understand what you were going for with the needle and thread in her mouth... and I see the need for it... but to be truthful the fact that the thread leads my eye out of the picture really bothers me - both in the thumbnail and the main image... I also would have liked to have perhaps seen her eyes not have that goldish tone. Nice sharp image though... imaginative... fun.  -8-</td>', 'very weird!  I like your use of blank space.  I understand what you were going for with the needle and thread in her mouth... and I see the need for it... but to be truthful the fact that the thread leads my eye out of the picture really bothers me - both in the thumbnail and the main image... I also would have liked to have perhaps seen her eyes not have that goldish tone. Nice sharp image though... imaginative... fun.  -8-', '2006-07-24 18:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655993, 368375, 60862, '<td valign="top">With razor sharp focus on the flower and bee, this would have really stood out.  I don''t mean tiny DOF; I mean both in focus.  Unfortunately, since neither is in focus, it comes across as a near-miss macro shot.</td>', 'With razor sharp focus on the flower and bee, this would have really stood out.  I don''t mean tiny DOF; I mean both in focus.  Unfortunately, since neither is in focus, it comes across as a near-miss macro shot.', '2006-07-24 18:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
