(2655997, 367203, 4967, '<td valign="top">While I see how you could get Cleapatra from this... I totally get a sense of ''Goldfinger'' the James Bond film... although perhaps not enough people would have gotten the refernce?  Regardless... Nicely done... decent lighting and I love the hint of blue in her eyes.  -9-</td>', 'While I see how you could get Cleapatra from this... I totally get a sense of ''Goldfinger'' the James Bond film... although perhaps not enough people would have gotten the refernce?  Regardless... Nicely done... decent lighting and I love the hint of blue in her eyes.  -9-', '2006-07-24 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2655999, 368701, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice composition and colours, the sky looks great.</td>', 'nice composition and colours, the sky looks great.', '2006-07-24 18:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656002, 366840, 55221, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2006-07-24 18:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656005, 368709, 60370, '<td valign="top">Since I have no idea what that is I could do without the bottle in the background.  The gelcaps make pretties on their own.</td>', 'Since I have no idea what that is I could do without the bottle in the background.  The gelcaps make pretties on their own.', '2006-07-24 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656007, 365401, 60862, '<td valign="top">This must be an emotional connection for you, and I appreciate your sharing it with us here.  I think, though, that there might have been other ways to more strongly connect the viewer with that emotion.<br/> <br/>First, the narrow DOF winds up drawing my eye to the very sharp texture in the cloth instead of onto the hair.<br/> <br/>Second, the hair''s placement doesn''t emotionally grab me.  As opposed to it being placed at the edge of a picture of her (sister?  mother?).  Or on a stand in the foreground, with someone in the background (blurred out), looking out a window.  There are a million ideas like that, but those are some examples.</td>', 'This must be an emotional connection for you, and I appreciate your sharing it with us here.  I think, though, that there might have been other ways to more strongly connect the viewer with that emotion. First, the narrow DOF winds up drawing my eye to the very sharp texture in the cloth instead of onto the hair. Second, the hair''s placement doesn''t emotionally grab me.  As opposed to it being placed at the edge of a picture of her (sister?  mother?).  Or on a stand in the foreground, with someone in the background (blurred out), looking out a window.  There are a million ideas like that, but those are some examples.', '2006-07-24 18:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656008, 367438, 55221, '<td valign="top">Ribbon material.</td>', 'Ribbon material.', '2006-07-24 18:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656011, 368689, 60862, '<td valign="top">With such a strong frame like this, I always look for something to be framed.  But there isn''t anything being framed.<br/> <br/>It''s a tough situation at this angle.</td>', 'With such a strong frame like this, I always look for something to be framed.  But there isn''t anything being framed. It''s a tough situation at this angle.', '2006-07-24 18:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656012, 368702, 55221, '<td valign="top">Pretty</td>', 'Pretty', '2006-07-24 18:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656015, 368359, 55221, '<td valign="top">One of the more believable Midas photographs</td>', 'One of the more believable Midas photographs', '2006-07-24 18:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656016, 366827, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great emotion in those eyes and her posture.  They match the title perfectly.<br/> <br/>And the strong contrast between her nose and her face, and then between her head and the background, lend an air of mystery, as if she''s seeing you in a deep alley.</td>', 'Great emotion in those eyes and her posture.  They match the title perfectly. And the strong contrast between her nose and her face, and then between her head and the background, lend an air of mystery, as if she''s seeing you in a deep alley.', '2006-07-24 18:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656017, 367507, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hope that''s a sunset and not a forest fire!</td>', 'Hope that''s a sunset and not a forest fire!', '2006-07-24 18:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
