(2656025, 368422, 60862, '<td valign="top">GREAT face on the little girl!  Reminds me of my own redhead.<br/> <br/>The contrast between their expressions sets my teeth on edge, though.  Maybe that''s what you intended. :)<br/> <br/>Ultimately, though, I find the connection to the challenge pretty slight.</td>', 'GREAT face on the little girl!  Reminds me of my own redhead. The contrast between their expressions sets my teeth on edge, though.  Maybe that''s what you intended. :) Ultimately, though, I find the connection to the challenge pretty slight.', '2006-07-24 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2656029, 367468, 60862, '<td valign="top">My first impression was "what is that? 4."  But then I stopped trying to make sense of it and just looked at the patterns of light, dark, and color, and I''m voting 6.</td>', 'My first impression was "what is that? 4."  But then I stopped trying to make sense of it and just looked at the patterns of light, dark, and color, and I''m voting 6.', '2006-07-24 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
