(2656035, 365519, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too straight-on for my taste.  Seems to be brushing up against literal depiction of existing artwork.  It''s got enough lighting and depth not to be DQ, but it''s not a very interesting angle.</td>', 'Too straight-on for my taste.  Seems to be brushing up against literal depiction of existing artwork.  It''s got enough lighting and depth not to be DQ, but it''s not a very interesting angle.', '2006-07-24 18:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
