(2657700, 367438, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is such a very strong image, and just what I expected from you, as you really do know how to do the very best, and quite dramatic portraits, and this is no exception..... A winning shot for sure, or at least on the front page..... I really hope you do "ribbon" with this one..... A "10" from me.</td>', 'This is such a very strong image, and just what I expected from you, as you really do know how to do the very best, and quite dramatic portraits, and this is no exception..... A winning shot for sure, or at least on the front page..... I really hope you do "ribbon" with this one..... A "10" from me.', '2006-07-25 08:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
