(2657747, 367470, 14671, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and clarity but the title makes the photo fit the challenge.  Its a Tiger Swallowtail not golden but an extremely nice capture.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent colors and clarity but the title makes the photo fit the challenge.  Its a Tiger Swallowtail not golden but an extremely nice capture.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 09:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657754, 368644, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  I''m not really sure what I''m looking at which is why this is hard to vote.  It looks almost like a macro of a microchip poking thru a leaf.  I''m not fond of the blurred background altho it does make it look landscapish which in itself is very cool.  Gonna give this a &lt;8&gt; in hopes that I''m right and because of the OOTB feeling.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  I''m not really sure what I''m looking at which is why this is hard to vote.  It looks almost like a macro of a microchip poking thru a leaf.  I''m not fond of the blurred background altho it does make it look landscapish which in itself is very cool.  Gonna give this a <8> in hopes that I''m right and because of the OOTB feeling.', '2006-07-25 09:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657758, 368235, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not to fond of this shot mainly because the hand model as an aged hand and there is something under the thumbnail.  The gold also doesn''t look very golden but more washed and pale.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I''m not to fond of this shot mainly because the hand model as an aged hand and there is something under the thumbnail.  The gold also doesn''t look very golden but more washed and pale.  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2006-07-25 09:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657761, 367203, 14671, '<td valign="top">While the photo fits the challenge I''m not to fond of this type of photo.  The title goes well and it is very clean and crisp just not pleasing to look at IMO.  Be it as it may I vote it a &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'While the photo fits the challenge I''m not to fond of this type of photo.  The title goes well and it is very clean and crisp just not pleasing to look at IMO.  Be it as it may I vote it a <7>', '2006-07-25 09:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657766, 368410, 14671, '<td valign="top">The glare off the nose of the model is very distracting and takes away from the photo itself.  Not a photo I''d expect to see hanging on a wall as it is.  The eyes are also crooked/unlevel and not enough to suggest it was done intentionally.  Also IMO I don''t think it fits the challenge very well.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The glare off the nose of the model is very distracting and takes away from the photo itself.  Not a photo I''d expect to see hanging on a wall as it is.  The eyes are also crooked/unlevel and not enough to suggest it was done intentionally.  Also IMO I don''t think it fits the challenge very well.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657774, 366153, 14671, '<td valign="top">At first glace I thought this was a very cool shot realizing what it was.  I bet this gets slammed for not being "gold".  Excellent clarity and color but DNMC IMO but your not getting marked down for that from me.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'At first glace I thought this was a very cool shot realizing what it was.  I bet this gets slammed for not being "gold".  Excellent clarity and color but DNMC IMO but your not getting marked down for that from me.  <7>', '2006-07-25 09:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
