(2657788, 367572, 14671, '<td valign="top">The brightness and contrast levels are off.  I''d decrease brightness by -10 and increase contrast by +10.  I''d also use the burn tool and darken the wood up giving it a little more character.  The title fits well to the photo and the tilt of the photo is pleasing and subtle.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'The brightness and contrast levels are off.  I''d decrease brightness by -10 and increase contrast by +10.  I''d also use the burn tool and darken the wood up giving it a little more character.  The title fits well to the photo and the tilt of the photo is pleasing and subtle.  Good luck in this challenge.  <6>', '2006-07-25 09:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657790, 365879, 50357, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2006-07-25 09:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657794, 368478, 14671, '<td valign="top">I was really hoping nobody would enter a shot like this because it DNMC IMO.  I do not see any "gold " in this photo and the photo overall has a bronze look to it.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'I was really hoping nobody would enter a shot like this because it DNMC IMO.  I do not see any "gold " in this photo and the photo overall has a bronze look to it.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 09:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657796, 368079, 50357, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-07-25 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657804, 366535, 14671, '<td valign="top">The hotspots off the golden globe arms is very distracting.  Kinda of aan interesting take to this challenge tho.  An almost abstract feeling to it.  The reflections in the globe are also distracting and could have been corrected with different lighting.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'The hotspots off the golden globe arms is very distracting.  Kinda of aan interesting take to this challenge tho.  An almost abstract feeling to it.  The reflections in the globe are also distracting and could have been corrected with different lighting.  Good luck in this challenge.  <6>', '2006-07-25 09:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
