(2657811, 367019, 14671, '<td valign="top">DNMC.  The challenge in "gold" not yellow and Is see no gold in this photo.  Its not even golden in color and I also don''t like the subject.  As far as the photo itself is, it has excellent clarity, very vibrant colors and nicely contrasted against the black background.  Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'DNMC.  The challenge in "gold" not yellow and Is see no gold in this photo.  Its not even golden in color and I also don''t like the subject.  As far as the photo itself is, it has excellent clarity, very vibrant colors and nicely contrasted against the black background.  Good luck in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 09:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2657812, 368542, 50357, '<td valign="top">This is great!</td>', 'This is great!', '2006-07-25 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
