(2658228, 366824, 14671, '<td valign="top">The size of this image is disturbing.  If you change the crop size then reduce image size you will find you can achieve a bigger image without losing quality.  As it stand I wouldn''t vote it higher then a &lt;4&gt; in any given challenge but in this challenge IMO it DNMC.  Its also very OoF/blurry and the contrast is way out.  Might I also suggest decreasing the contrast by -20 and then adjusting the brightness to fit. Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'The size of this image is disturbing.  If you change the crop size then reduce image size you will find you can achieve a bigger image without losing quality.  As it stand I wouldn''t vote it higher then a <4> in any given challenge but in this challenge IMO it DNMC.  Its also very OoF/blurry and the contrast is way out.  Might I also suggest decreasing the contrast by -20 and then adjusting the brightness to fit. Good luck in this challenge.', '2006-07-25 12:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2658245, 368132, 14671, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection to the title and I''ve seen a lot of this.  Might I suggest the model puts some hand cream on to soften the skin tones up a bit and not look so aged.  It also would have taken the high contrast off of the finger.  The photo itself has nice choice in DoF and is a fairly interesting photo because the gold appears to be graduated from the tip of the finger to the leaf and so on.   Great colors and clarity.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I don''t get the connection to the title and I''ve seen a lot of this.  Might I suggest the model puts some hand cream on to soften the skin tones up a bit and not look so aged.  It also would have taken the high contrast off of the finger.  The photo itself has nice choice in DoF and is a fairly interesting photo because the gold appears to be graduated from the tip of the finger to the leaf and so on.   Great colors and clarity.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2006-07-25 12:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
