(2658377, 368602, 14671, '<td valign="top">To me this image is way to over sharpened and has nothing to do with the challenge.  The title is the only connection to the challenge and to me thats a little to weak this time.  However the image itself is fairly pleasing and if it wasn''t so sharp would be something I''d expect to see in a calender or on a wall.  The stop motion of the birds is very impressive and goe well against the small cityscape in the background.  I also like the way the dock draws your eyes into the photo.  Giood luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'To me this image is way to over sharpened and has nothing to do with the challenge.  The title is the only connection to the challenge and to me thats a little to weak this time.  However the image itself is fairly pleasing and if it wasn''t so sharp would be something I''d expect to see in a calender or on a wall.  The stop motion of the birds is very impressive and goe well against the small cityscape in the background.  I also like the way the dock draws your eyes into the photo.  Giood luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2006-07-25 12:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
