(2659057, 366914, 16004, '<td valign="top">regrettably, the wonkiness is a major distraction, though it does make the shot slightly pisa-esque.  it also feels that there is slightly too much in the picture - i''d personally have been tempted to focus on the middle row of windows and the lovely intricate bit of stonework just above them.  i think the bit of the church that isn''t the tower takes away from the overall impact.  the grey sky is a bit dull, but quite effective i think in enhancing the gold illumination of the tower.  it has an awful lot of promise, this picture.  fits the challenge, too.  5.</td>', 'regrettably, the wonkiness is a major distraction, though it does make the shot slightly pisa-esque.  it also feels that there is slightly too much in the picture - i''d personally have been tempted to focus on the middle row of windows and the lovely intricate bit of stonework just above them.  i think the bit of the church that isn''t the tower takes away from the overall impact.  the grey sky is a bit dull, but quite effective i think in enhancing the gold illumination of the tower.  it has an awful lot of promise, this picture.  fits the challenge, too.  5.', '2006-07-25 15:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659080, 368467, 16004, '<td valign="top">looks kinda abstract - can''t tell if it''s a dress or bag.  i think the material would have made a fantastic macro, but really feels a bit too fussy to completely enjoy.  not sure what''s happening on the left hand side either.  4.</td>', 'looks kinda abstract - can''t tell if it''s a dress or bag.  i think the material would have made a fantastic macro, but really feels a bit too fussy to completely enjoy.  not sure what''s happening on the left hand side either.  4.', '2006-07-25 15:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659081, 368604, 61971, '<td valign="top">This idea is awesome. The overall feel would be a little better if there was some soft light in the plants. Not a lot though because the lighting on the pot looks really good the way it is.</td>', 'This idea is awesome. The overall feel would be a little better if there was some soft light in the plants. Not a lot though because the lighting on the pot looks really good the way it is.', '2006-07-25 15:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659098, 367033, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s a very beautiful portrait. A shot I would be proud of. I am not too sure about the crop here and I have no idea how it was framed or cropped, but I do know that it was cropped for some reason.<br/> <br/>I also believe that someone who can produce this portrait would have made a good judgement seeing it from a different point of view.<br/> <br/>So whatever it is, I think it''s one of the best images in the challenge. <br/> <br/>** I have been observing the image while I was wring the comment, and the crop doesn''t bother me that much anymore. I think I am seeing what you wanted me to see.<br/> <br/>All the best.</td>', 'It''s a very beautiful portrait. A shot I would be proud of. I am not too sure about the crop here and I have no idea how it was framed or cropped, but I do know that it was cropped for some reason. I also believe that someone who can produce this portrait would have made a good judgement seeing it from a different point of view. So whatever it is, I think it''s one of the best images in the challenge.  ** I have been observing the image while I was wring the comment, and the crop doesn''t bother me that much anymore. I think I am seeing what you wanted me to see. All the best.', '2006-07-25 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659225, 368188, 60370, '<td valign="top">Excellent excellent!  I love the haunted reflection. 10</td>', 'Excellent excellent!  I love the haunted reflection. 10', '2006-07-25 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659236, 368453, 60370, '<td valign="top">Awwww, what a face!  Fisheye would be great on this one :)</td>', 'Awwww, what a face!  Fisheye would be great on this one :)', '2006-07-25 16:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659255, 365940, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Your wife is becoming pretty recognizable.</td>', 'Nice picture. Your wife is becoming pretty recognizable.', '2006-07-25 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659258, 365879, 60370, '<td valign="top">I still do ;-)</td>', 'I still do ;-)', '2006-07-25 16:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
