(2659310, 368102, 62739, '<td valign="top">Well, he has more teeth then I do at his age. Gold or not. So for that a 10! :-)</td>', 'Well, he has more teeth then I do at his age. Gold or not. So for that a 10! :-)', '2006-07-25 17:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
