(2659405, 368381, 42100, '<td valign="top">The rich and bright colors is very pleasing to the eye.  The motion blur in the wings is very cool also.  Well done!</td>', 'The rich and bright colors is very pleasing to the eye.  The motion blur in the wings is very cool also.  Well done!', '2006-07-25 17:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659421, 367415, 45115, '<td valign="top">That''s a kick ass picture... it deserves a top 10 for sure! Good luck mate!</td>', 'That''s a kick ass picture... it deserves a top 10 for sure! Good luck mate!', '2006-07-25 18:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2659426, 368635, 14211, '<td valign="top">This definitely rates a ten...a true beauty. It seems as if the bow of the canoe is being lifted out of the water. You can almost hear the canoe as it passes through the water. I love it.</td>', 'This definitely rates a ten...a true beauty. It seems as if the bow of the canoe is being lifted out of the water. You can almost hear the canoe as it passes through the water. I love it.', '2006-07-25 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
