(2662088, 365940, 14671, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very painful shoot not to mention messy.  Interesting take to this challenge.  The photo has excellent clarity and is probably unique to this challenge its not a photo I''d expect to see on a wall as it doesn''t have any wow factor.  Other then that good job.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This looks like a very painful shoot not to mention messy.  Interesting take to this challenge.  The photo has excellent clarity and is probably unique to this challenge its not a photo I''d expect to see on a wall as it doesn''t have any wow factor.  Other then that good job.  Good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2006-07-26 06:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
