(2663026, 367033, 59891, '<td valign="top">This lad probably already has females of all ages dropping at his feet.  I love the dramatic lighting.  The warm lighting works far better for me than gold paint and I like how the light in the background balances the composition.  Great shot!</td>', 'This lad probably already has females of all ages dropping at his feet.  I love the dramatic lighting.  The warm lighting works far better for me than gold paint and I like how the light in the background balances the composition.  Great shot!', '2006-07-26 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2663060, 368188, 59891, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What an artistic use of...whatever it is you did to make it look like she is turning into an old masters painting. I don''t know how much of the "old masters" part was during the shot and how much was during PP...and I guess it doesn''t matter. I love it!</td>', 'Wow!  What an artistic use of...whatever it is you did to make it look like she is turning into an old masters painting. I don''t know how much of the "old masters" part was during the shot and how much was during PP...and I guess it doesn''t matter. I love it!', '2006-07-26 11:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
