(2666564, 368595, 37252, '<td valign="top">there is something about the sky - looks mottled or pixelated. When I scroll down to the comment box, I notice that a more interesting crop would have been to crop the entire sky out - leaving just the fainter color trees at the top.</td>', 'there is something about the sky - looks mottled or pixelated. When I scroll down to the comment box, I notice that a more interesting crop would have been to crop the entire sky out - leaving just the fainter color trees at the top.', '2006-07-27 02:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
