(2666748, 367415, 44611, '<td valign="top">The pink hue on the hills in the background is very distracting to me - it really doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image at all.  Also I think I might have been inclined to crop more of the shadowed pier in the foreground as that also detracts from the silhouetted figures.</td>', 'The pink hue on the hills in the background is very distracting to me - it really doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image at all.  Also I think I might have been inclined to crop more of the shadowed pier in the foreground as that also detracts from the silhouetted figures.', '2006-07-27 04:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2666766, 368633, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I really do not like the framing; it is distracting and unbalanced.</td>', 'Great shot but I really do not like the framing; it is distracting and unbalanced.', '2006-07-27 04:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2666775, 368405, 44611, '<td valign="top">Perfect clarity - a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Perfect clarity - a beautiful shot.', '2006-07-27 04:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2666776, 367747, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great work with fabulous colour.  The shadow on the left is perhaps a little distracting and I would like figure to be a bit clearer, but still one of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Great work with fabulous colour.  The shadow on the left is perhaps a little distracting and I would like figure to be a bit clearer, but still one of my top picks for this challenge.', '2006-07-27 04:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2666778, 368705, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely horse shot.  I think the colour could have a bit more depth/pop to it however.</td>', 'Lovely horse shot.  I think the colour could have a bit more depth/pop to it however.', '2006-07-27 04:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2666779, 368635, 44611, '<td valign="top">Generally I''m not a fan of centred subjects but just occasionally they really work and this is one of those occasions.  The way the helm of the boat leads the eye to the shore and horizon is great.</td>', 'Generally I''m not a fan of centred subjects but just occasionally they really work and this is one of those occasions.  The way the helm of the boat leads the eye to the shore and horizon is great.', '2006-07-27 04:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
