(2667983, 367620, 47534, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph - this is the type of work I search for when in need of inspiration!!!  Absolutely beautiful job... terrific focus / depth of field, amazing colors, wonderful model, and if this doesnt ribbon I may have to just give up on DPC!!!  A definite 10 in every way.  :)</td>', 'Stunning photograph - this is the type of work I search for when in need of inspiration!!!  Absolutely beautiful job... terrific focus / depth of field, amazing colors, wonderful model, and if this doesnt ribbon I may have to just give up on DPC!!!  A definite 10 in every way.  :)', '2006-07-27 14:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668002, 367438, 47534, '<td valign="top">Uhhhh - just how did you piss her off so bad?!?!?!  Well done - many others attempted this type of shot, but yours does a great job of including EMOTION in the image.  Nice work!</td>', 'Uhhhh - just how did you piss her off so bad?!?!?!  Well done - many others attempted this type of shot, but yours does a great job of including EMOTION in the image.  Nice work!', '2006-07-27 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668036, 368714, 47534, '<td valign="top">I don''t care how others vote for this - you get points in my book for even TRYING humor on this site!!!  Could use a little more (even?) lighting, but I still like the attempt!</td>', 'I don''t care how others vote for this - you get points in my book for even TRYING humor on this site!!!  Could use a little more (even?) lighting, but I still like the attempt!', '2006-07-27 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668056, 368218, 47534, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh but, I like it anyway!!!  Terrific capture, and I hope you rewarded this brave model appropriately!!!!  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh but, I like it anyway!!!  Terrific capture, and I hope you rewarded this brave model appropriately!!!!  Keep up the good work.', '2006-07-27 14:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668072, 367416, 47534, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, but this person almost looks TOO young to be doing this... either that, or my being a father of 3 young girls is catching up with me!  Ummmm... very nice lighting, and overall a wonderful job!!!</td>', 'I am sorry, but this person almost looks TOO young to be doing this... either that, or my being a father of 3 young girls is catching up with me!  Ummmm... very nice lighting, and overall a wonderful job!!!', '2006-07-27 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668104, 368227, 47534, '<td valign="top">Ok, let''s just get this part outta the way.... this is incredibly hot and arousing!!!!!!!   Whew!  Okay, about the picture quality - this is an absolutely beautiful image. (maybe its testosterone speaking, but would it have been more powerful to have her nipple visible?)  Anyway, fantastic work that literally took my breath away!!!!!</td>', 'Ok, let''s just get this part outta the way.... this is incredibly hot and arousing!!!!!!!   Whew!  Okay, about the picture quality - this is an absolutely beautiful image. (maybe its testosterone speaking, but would it have been more powerful to have her nipple visible?)  Anyway, fantastic work that literally took my breath away!!!!!', '2006-07-27 15:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
