(2670502, 366516, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome picture - the colors are lovely and the well-defined stalks of grass are eye-catching. i think a 4x5 crop might have suited this image better - here the red flowers are a bit to small to really anchor the composition. cutting off some of the space at the top would tighten up the image nicely. also - use the full 640 pixels!</td>', 'this is an awesome picture - the colors are lovely and the well-defined stalks of grass are eye-catching. i think a 4x5 crop might have suited this image better - here the red flowers are a bit to small to really anchor the composition. cutting off some of the space at the top would tighten up the image nicely. also - use the full 640 pixels!', '2006-07-28 03:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
