(2672986, 368630, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nicely punned title!  Great photo!  Even the tlit adds a sense of whimsy to an otherwise stiff &amp; sterile environment.  Thank your for this offering!  Let me be an usher in this church!  ;)</td>', 'Nicely punned title!  Great photo!  Even the tlit adds a sense of whimsy to an otherwise stiff & sterile environment.  Thank your for this offering!  Let me be an usher in this church!  ;)', '2006-07-29 00:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2673003, 367620, 50034, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the privilege of voting on the work of a master photographer!  This is a great photo!  I have always been drawn to backlighting, which is certainly easier to capture in nature than it is to create with human models since we are so opaque.  You have done both very well.  Your model has great hair for this purpose.  The wheat is made for this kind of lighting.  To top it all off you have lit her right side with great fill flash (or maybe gold reflective board.)  Nice job!</td>', 'Thank you for the privilege of voting on the work of a master photographer!  This is a great photo!  I have always been drawn to backlighting, which is certainly easier to capture in nature than it is to create with human models since we are so opaque.  You have done both very well.  Your model has great hair for this purpose.  The wheat is made for this kind of lighting.  To top it all off you have lit her right side with great fill flash (or maybe gold reflective board.)  Nice job!', '2006-07-29 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2673018, 368700, 50034, '<td valign="top">Mighty fine gold, Cowgirl!</td>', 'Mighty fine gold, Cowgirl!', '2006-07-29 00:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
