(2673534, 368102, 53147, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot. Wonderful model and the selective desat is perfect. Looking forward to seeing a ribbon by this picture. Love it! <br/> <br/>Edit - Back again to bump this one up - my top pick of the challenge and giving you the final two points to make it a ten. Great shot!<br/> <br/>Edit one last time - wish I could give you one more point but I cant. So instead I add this to my favorite pics.<br/> <br/>OK one more edit - I am tellin ya I love this shot. My wife just got home from a week long business trip and before I showed her my future entry I showed her this one. I am gonna be so mad if you dont ribbon. (Seriously I am not a DPC stalker)</td>', 'Brilliant shot. Wonderful model and the selective desat is perfect. Looking forward to seeing a ribbon by this picture. Love it!  Edit - Back again to bump this one up - my top pick of the challenge and giving you the final two points to make it a ten. Great shot! Edit one last time - wish I could give you one more point but I cant. So instead I add this to my favorite pics. OK one more edit - I am tellin ya I love this shot. My wife just got home from a week long business trip and before I showed her my future entry I showed her this one. I am gonna be so mad if you dont ribbon. (Seriously I am not a DPC stalker)', '2006-07-29 09:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
