(2673542, 368353, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot and nice colors. A shame that your sky has so many dark clouds as a lightly cloudy blue sky would have been great and send this one over the top. Great capture and I hope this does well for you. One of my top picks in the challenge. Back to bump - this shot really makes me smile - Great job!</td>', 'Great shot and nice colors. A shame that your sky has so many dark clouds as a lightly cloudy blue sky would have been great and send this one over the top. Great capture and I hope this does well for you. One of my top picks in the challenge. Back to bump - this shot really makes me smile - Great job!', '2006-07-29 09:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
