(2675661, 368471, 34938, '<td valign="top">someone went vrazy with the spray paint! this is good and the reflection of the hand is nice, but it lacks ooomph imho anyway...good effort, I am bumping this up for effort</td>', 'someone went vrazy with the spray paint! this is good and the reflection of the hand is nice, but it lacks ooomph imho anyway...good effort, I am bumping this up for effort', '2006-07-30 04:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
