(2675665, 368108, 34938, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you can add a border like this under the rules, in any case, why save the shot at such a small size when you have 640 px at your disposal. I like the sky and the pose, but perhaps a better effort on size and border next time...sorry</td>', 'Not sure if you can add a border like this under the rules, in any case, why save the shot at such a small size when you have 640 px at your disposal. I like the sky and the pose, but perhaps a better effort on size and border next time...sorry', '2006-07-30 04:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675669, 367468, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract qualities of this...you really cannot tell what it is...water in a fountain? I am bumping this up now that I have had another couple of looks</td>', 'I like the abstract qualities of this...you really cannot tell what it is...water in a fountain? I am bumping this up now that I have had another couple of looks', '2006-07-30 04:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675672, 365559, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow, that sparkles...I think the lighting is a little harsh and there''s a fair bit of blurriness</td>', 'wow, that sparkles...I think the lighting is a little harsh and there''s a fair bit of blurriness', '2006-07-30 04:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675673, 365519, 34938, '<td valign="top">good as a square crop</td>', 'good as a square crop', '2006-07-30 04:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675675, 366720, 34938, '<td valign="top">I''d like to get excited about this, but it really doesn''t have a wow factor...taking pictures of boxes...not really my thing here, sorry</td>', 'I''d like to get excited about this, but it really doesn''t have a wow factor...taking pictures of boxes...not really my thing here, sorry', '2006-07-30 04:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675677, 368646, 34938, '<td valign="top">actually, this could be anywhere in the world these days...a little on the blurry side, perhaps overexposed...good light trails though</td>', 'actually, this could be anywhere in the world these days...a little on the blurry side, perhaps overexposed...good light trails though', '2006-07-30 04:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675678, 368254, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the light and the perspective...is the horizon just a little off? Nice though....bumping up a little</td>', 'I love the light and the perspective...is the horizon just a little off? Nice though....bumping up a little', '2006-07-30 04:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675792, 368528, 31133, '<td valign="top">Pretty color of gold. The skyline is beautiful, but there''s something missing for me - I''m sorry, but I don''t know what it is. Maybe too much water, or the black line starting just below the skyline, or sharpness. I''m sorry I can''t describe clearly what it is. But I do like the color of the sky and the buildings you chose for this very much.</td>', 'Pretty color of gold. The skyline is beautiful, but there''s something missing for me - I''m sorry, but I don''t know what it is. Maybe too much water, or the black line starting just below the skyline, or sharpness. I''m sorry I can''t describe clearly what it is. But I do like the color of the sky and the buildings you chose for this very much.', '2006-07-30 08:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675796, 368107, 31133, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, gorgeous! Bet this wins. The flying bird is so perfectly placed! I''m guessing this is Oregon - and really looking forward to seeing this after the challenge! Since Larus means both gull and our famous Icelandic member, I''m guessing this is a tribute to the gull, even though the quality matches that of Larus the member :-) Great job!</td>', 'Gorgeous, gorgeous! Bet this wins. The flying bird is so perfectly placed! I''m guessing this is Oregon - and really looking forward to seeing this after the challenge! Since Larus means both gull and our famous Icelandic member, I''m guessing this is a tribute to the gull, even though the quality matches that of Larus the member :-) Great job!', '2006-07-30 08:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675799, 368175, 31133, '<td valign="top">Impressive piece of history. I think the votes would be much higher if the wood grain were less prominent.</td>', 'Impressive piece of history. I think the votes would be much higher if the wood grain were less prominent.', '2006-07-30 08:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675800, 368525, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract! Lines, swirls, colors... you''ve got it all here.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract! Lines, swirls, colors... you''ve got it all here.', '2006-07-30 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675802, 368417, 31133, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is very good. To give it more interest, this might''ve benefited from a different angle or crop. The two tops of the building, especially the angled one at right, do add interest in a good way, though.</td>', 'Technically, this is very good. To give it more interest, this might''ve benefited from a different angle or crop. The two tops of the building, especially the angled one at right, do add interest in a good way, though.', '2006-07-30 08:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675803, 367033, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I love his expression, sooo delicate, the highlights in his hair, and the grain overall.</td>', 'Wonderful! I love his expression, sooo delicate, the highlights in his hair, and the grain overall.', '2006-07-30 08:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675809, 365911, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love this! Hope it does well. The people and colors near the bottom are like a dream. The spikes on the flames are magical.</td>', 'I love this! Hope it does well. The people and colors near the bottom are like a dream. The spikes on the flames are magical.', '2006-07-30 08:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675812, 368254, 31133, '<td valign="top">This definitely meets the challenge and technically looks sufficiently sharp and of decent quality. For me though, there''s too much to look at at once. My eye doesn''t know where to go because of the distractions to right and left. I hope you don''t mind my criticism at all.</td>', 'This definitely meets the challenge and technically looks sufficiently sharp and of decent quality. For me though, there''s too much to look at at once. My eye doesn''t know where to go because of the distractions to right and left. I hope you don''t mind my criticism at all.', '2006-07-30 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675813, 368132, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the several Midas shots I''ve seen. I like how you''ve got the gold flakes to flow from the finger to the leaf.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the several Midas shots I''ve seen. I like how you''ve got the gold flakes to flow from the finger to the leaf.', '2006-07-30 08:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675890, 368437, 43714, '<td valign="top">Wow! This really meets the challenge. Great texture, colours and lighting. Love it!!!!</td>', 'Wow! This really meets the challenge. Great texture, colours and lighting. Love it!!!!', '2006-07-30 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676001, 367438, 25397, '<td valign="top">Elvi elvi elvi<br/>This is too good.<br/>First thing I thought of when the gold challenge came up was that first entry of yours. Good luck man</td>', 'Elvi elvi elviThis is too good.First thing I thought of when the gold challenge came up was that first entry of yours. Good luck man', '2006-07-30 12:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676002, 367436, 25397, '<td valign="top">Artistic, bold and naked. Everything I could ask for.</td>', 'Artistic, bold and naked. Everything I could ask for.', '2006-07-30 12:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676003, 366840, 25397, '<td valign="top">Looks good even off the mushrooms! Favourite from me, stellar work. I can''t believe it. It''s no wonder I didn''t understand your LCD monitor.<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'Looks good even off the mushrooms! Favourite from me, stellar work. I can''t believe it. It''s no wonder I didn''t understand your LCD monitor. 10', '2006-07-30 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676058, 368426, 15032, '<td valign="top">Definately a pick of mine for a ribbon.  This picture would have been perfect if you had a bit more sky above the building.</td>', 'Definately a pick of mine for a ribbon.  This picture would have been perfect if you had a bit more sky above the building.', '2006-07-30 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1);
