(2676082, 365709, 15032, '<td valign="top">I think this may be a stretch for the gold challenge.  But I would suggest either a greater DOF so the whole face is in focus, or a much tighter DOF for the effect.</td>', 'I think this may be a stretch for the gold challenge.  But I would suggest either a greater DOF so the whole face is in focus, or a much tighter DOF for the effect.', '2006-07-30 13:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
