(2676085, 366824, 15032, '<td valign="top">If this image were well-focused it would make it much stronger.  Don''t get too close for your lense.  But nice colors overall.</td>', 'If this image were well-focused it would make it much stronger.  Don''t get too close for your lense.  But nice colors overall.', '2006-07-30 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
