(2676450, 367030, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is a good entry. Clearly recognizable as stained glass, but also has a kind of alluring, abstract feel to it.</td>', 'This is a good entry. Clearly recognizable as stained glass, but also has a kind of alluring, abstract feel to it.', '2006-07-30 17:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
