(2676455, 368700, 49865, '<td valign="top">Blond girl in a straw hat in front of wheat or some other brittle bleached grass. Classic subject material for a "Gold" challenge, and the execution is great. The shallow depth of focus works well, creating a simple gold background - this would''ve also been a good entry for the color on color challenge.</td>', 'Blond girl in a straw hat in front of wheat or some other brittle bleached grass. Classic subject material for a "Gold" challenge, and the execution is great. The shallow depth of focus works well, creating a simple gold background - this would''ve also been a good entry for the color on color challenge.', '2006-07-30 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676456, 366294, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks like bear''s work...  Very nice.  Love the tones and composition.<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks like bear''s work...  Very nice.  Love the tones and composition.TC', '2006-07-30 17:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676458, 368102, 49865, '<td valign="top">What a face! Such character. Clever idea for the challenge, and I like how it came out. The teeth stand out extremely well because the face has such a deeply textured, rough look, and the teeth are so smooth and featureless.</td>', 'What a face! Such character. Clever idea for the challenge, and I like how it came out. The teeth stand out extremely well because the face has such a deeply textured, rough look, and the teeth are so smooth and featureless.', '2006-07-30 17:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676459, 368542, 49865, '<td valign="top">Makes me want chocolate. Good choice of subject. Composition could be improved with maybe a bit more space between the top of the image and the chocolate.</td>', 'Makes me want chocolate. Good choice of subject. Composition could be improved with maybe a bit more space between the top of the image and the chocolate.', '2006-07-30 17:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
