(2678316, 368380, 19708, '<td valign="top">Amazing - I thought those were real stitches. ;)<br/>You healed well :)<br/>Congrats - You certainly have a flair for creativity!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-31 02:39:01.</i></td>', 'Amazing - I thought those were real stitches. ;)You healed well :)Congrats - You certainly have a flair for creativity!', '2006-07-31 03:38:36.000000', '2006-07-31 03:39:01.000000', 0),
(2678335, 365769, 37858, '<td valign="top">What I liked about this photo was the lighting and the perspective.  The bottom up view made this look like a advertisement photo.  It is clear and well lit.  What I was not so wild about was the slim link to "Gold" - the word is there and a bit of the color, but not enough for me to really appreciate the link.  That said, I scored it a 6 and would have scored it higher if I thought the color was better represented.</td>', 'What I liked about this photo was the lighting and the perspective.  The bottom up view made this look like a advertisement photo.  It is clear and well lit.  What I was not so wild about was the slim link to "Gold" - the word is there and a bit of the color, but not enough for me to really appreciate the link.  That said, I scored it a 6 and would have scored it higher if I thought the color was better represented.', '2006-07-31 03:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678355, 368525, 37858, '<td valign="top">What I liked about this image is your creativity and the overall design of the photo.  Despite the obvious effects of reflections in water, the shot is clear and technically well made.  I scored this a 5 and struggled to rate it higher.  However on my monitor the building looks yellow to beige rather than gold.  (I hope it''s not my monitor.  I don''t think it is because calibration information suggests it''s ok.)  In the end, I stuck with 5 because I liked the image but felt it wasn''t really "gold".  (no DNMC, just a shade off.)</td>', 'What I liked about this image is your creativity and the overall design of the photo.  Despite the obvious effects of reflections in water, the shot is clear and technically well made.  I scored this a 5 and struggled to rate it higher.  However on my monitor the building looks yellow to beige rather than gold.  (I hope it''s not my monitor.  I don''t think it is because calibration information suggests it''s ok.)  In the end, I stuck with 5 because I liked the image but felt it wasn''t really "gold".  (no DNMC, just a shade off.)', '2006-07-31 03:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678375, 368596, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading post Comment<br/> <br/>I''ve read your "Perils of Pauline" explanation of this shot.  I''m not sure I blame your daughter...she''s a saint.  When voting I didn''t think the gold was working (now I know why), but I thought your daughter''s expression was cute...so I didn''t vote too harshly. 5.  (Next time use her in a photo that won''t cover her face...she''ll probably appreciate it and you''ll probably score higher.<br/></td>', 'Trading post Comment I''ve read your "Perils of Pauline" explanation of this shot.  I''m not sure I blame your daughter...she''s a saint.  When voting I didn''t think the gold was working (now I know why), but I thought your daughter''s expression was cute...so I didn''t vote too harshly. 5.  (Next time use her in a photo that won''t cover her face...she''ll probably appreciate it and you''ll probably score higher.', '2006-07-31 04:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678381, 368701, 60899, '<td valign="top">Too good , definately one of the best sunset shots i have see :)</td>', 'Too good , definately one of the best sunset shots i have see :)', '2006-07-31 04:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678386, 366777, 34938, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8...I think it was underrated and the ''not a great model'' comment below intrigues me...she''s gorgeous</td>', 'I gave this an 8...I think it was underrated and the ''not a great model'' comment below intrigues me...she''s gorgeous', '2006-07-31 04:04:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678396, 366316, 34938, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 Amy...I think it was definitely underrated. I made my comments to you during the challenge about the hair, but other than that it''s a great shot</td>', 'I gave this a 7 Amy...I think it was definitely underrated. I made my comments to you during the challenge about the hair, but other than that it''s a great shot', '2006-07-31 04:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678432, 368437, 57166, '<td valign="top">Great shot and very well thought out.  Well done!!</td>', 'Great shot and very well thought out.  Well done!!', '2006-07-31 04:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678438, 368635, 60862, '<td valign="top">I voted 6 for this.  I noticed the similarity to the other one, but they''re different enought that it didn''t even occur to me to worry about it.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice picture - good color and exposure on the canoe, and the tip of it makes a nice intersection with the shore.</td>', 'I voted 6 for this.  I noticed the similarity to the other one, but they''re different enought that it didn''t even occur to me to worry about it. It''s a nice picture - good color and exposure on the canoe, and the tip of it makes a nice intersection with the shore.', '2006-07-31 04:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678441, 368271, 57166, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the fuzziness but then I take alot of fuzzy pictures.  I liked it and saw past it to what you were going for.  A 7 that was well earned.  Well done!</td>', 'I don''t mind the fuzziness but then I take alot of fuzzy pictures.  I liked it and saw past it to what you were going for.  A 7 that was well earned.  Well done!', '2006-07-31 04:22:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678444, 368380, 28742, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Great effort and superb execution on all counts. I''d add you to my fav''s but it says you are already there. :) Congratulations Mackenzie, you are a super photographer with broad talents! :)</td>', 'Fantastic! Great effort and superb execution on all counts. I''d add you to my fav''s but it says you are already there. :) Congratulations Mackenzie, you are a super photographer with broad talents! :)', '2006-07-31 04:24:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678447, 368653, 57166, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I really really like it.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I really really like it.', '2006-07-31 04:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678449, 368102, 28097, '<td valign="top">great post processing, congratulations ..</td>', 'great post processing, congratulations ..', '2006-07-31 04:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678452, 368699, 35786, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7... her face is expressionless and you can barely see her eyes which is a disappointment here. However it is perfectly lit and an interesting idea, thus the 7 :0)</td>', 'I gave you a 7... her face is expressionless and you can barely see her eyes which is a disappointment here. However it is perfectly lit and an interesting idea, thus the 7 :0)', '2006-07-31 04:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678457, 365901, 57166, '<td valign="top">Well if nothing else its unique.  Folks here like the images to be 640 or your votes come in low.  It''s not a bad shot it got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Well if nothing else its unique.  Folks here like the images to be 640 or your votes come in low.  It''s not a bad shot it got a 7 from me.', '2006-07-31 04:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678459, 368699, 20462, '<td valign="top">you know I usually don''t comment on underateds, but this was amazingly so.  Takes thought and as kiwiness said, a healthy dose of cinematic knowledge (but that isn''t a must to enjoy it).</td>', 'you know I usually don''t comment on underateds, but this was amazingly so.  Takes thought and as kiwiness said, a healthy dose of cinematic knowledge (but that isn''t a must to enjoy it).', '2006-07-31 04:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
