(2678501, 368706, 36999, '<td valign="top">I like the nest idea.  The gold egg might have looked a little more gold if the others had been white.</td>', 'I like the nest idea.  The gold egg might have looked a little more gold if the others had been white.', '2006-07-31 04:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678504, 365940, 34938, '<td valign="top">Incredibly underrated...you were robbed blind! 34 out of 296??? This was a really inconsistent result for most shots, but this one astounds me. I gave it one of only 3 10''s in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Makes you want to scream doesn''t it?</td>', 'Incredibly underrated...you were robbed blind! 34 out of 296??? This was a really inconsistent result for most shots, but this one astounds me. I gave it one of only 3 10''s in this challenge.  Makes you want to scream doesn''t it?', '2006-07-31 04:42:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678505, 366316, 36999, '<td valign="top">Lovely and underrated me thinks.</td>', 'Lovely and underrated me thinks.', '2006-07-31 04:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678508, 367438, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 13th placing, but you were robbed really. One of three shots I gave 10 to...sorry that the other voters didn''t see it like me</td>', 'Congrats on your 13th placing, but you were robbed really. One of three shots I gave 10 to...sorry that the other voters didn''t see it like me', '2006-07-31 04:43:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678515, 366840, 3032, '<td valign="top">Your best work ever. :)</td>', 'Your best work ever. :)', '2006-07-31 04:47:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678521, 368699, 31133, '<td valign="top">I agree that this is under-rated. I gave this a 6, which is (for comparison) the same as I rated place #7. To me, it was obvious that a lot of work was put into this entry and that it met the challenge. The reasons I didn''t rate it higher are because the effect might have been a little too subtle. Had her hair been blowing backwards even more, facial expression showing some surprise, and light more dramatic, I would''ve given this a 9 or 10. But how on earth you ended up way back here in place 251 is beyond me! This was a really good entry.</td>', 'I agree that this is under-rated. I gave this a 6, which is (for comparison) the same as I rated place #7. To me, it was obvious that a lot of work was put into this entry and that it met the challenge. The reasons I didn''t rate it higher are because the effect might have been a little too subtle. Had her hair been blowing backwards even more, facial expression showing some surprise, and light more dramatic, I would''ve given this a 9 or 10. But how on earth you ended up way back here in place 251 is beyond me! This was a really good entry.', '2006-07-31 04:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678547, 367436, 31133, '<td valign="top">Kelly, this is beautiful! I missed it completely during voting which is too bad, ''cause I would''ve loved to see this unique entry then. It''s airy thanks to the cloth and dark thanks to the tones from processing and/or light. That contrast (airy/dark) is what appeals to me most. The cloth (and her body!) is stunning. Nice, nice work!!</td>', 'Kelly, this is beautiful! I missed it completely during voting which is too bad, ''cause I would''ve loved to see this unique entry then. It''s airy thanks to the cloth and dark thanks to the tones from processing and/or light. That contrast (airy/dark) is what appeals to me most. The cloth (and her body!) is stunning. Nice, nice work!!', '2006-07-31 05:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678555, 368188, 55221, '<td valign="top">Toldya you''d win a ribbon!</td>', 'Toldya you''d win a ribbon!', '2006-07-31 05:23:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678560, 368525, 31133, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 - it was gold, and it was beautiful in my eyes and on my monitor. I''m a sucker for swirly water reflections, though. The colors really are exquisite. Nice job!</td>', 'I gave this a 9 - it was gold, and it was beautiful in my eyes and on my monitor. I''m a sucker for swirly water reflections, though. The colors really are exquisite. Nice job!', '2006-07-31 05:26:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678563, 368701, 27137, '<td valign="top">Alright Matt!</td>', 'Alright Matt!', '2006-07-31 05:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678575, 366780, 62242, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it - how did the picture so well? It''s a good picture, but even the photographer admitted he just copied another picture IDENTICALLY except for the colour, and even that was just from in camera fake colouration. Doesn''t creativity and originality count for anything. How does it place in top 10?</td>', 'I don''t get it - how did the picture so well? It''s a good picture, but even the photographer admitted he just copied another picture IDENTICALLY except for the colour, and even that was just from in camera fake colouration. Doesn''t creativity and originality count for anything. How does it place in top 10?', '2006-07-31 05:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678578, 368633, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonder how people felt about the border, heehee ;-) I gave this an 8, which means I''m surprised to find it back here. The dof is really great, as is the clarity and the meeting of the challenge. It looks like this fence goes on forever and ever - really nice!</td>', 'Wow, wonder how people felt about the border, heehee ;-) I gave this an 8, which means I''m surprised to find it back here. The dof is really great, as is the clarity and the meeting of the challenge. It looks like this fence goes on forever and ever - really nice!', '2006-07-31 05:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678580, 367747, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. I''m assuming there was no scoreboard in the background there. :P</td>', 'Congratulations. I''m assuming there was no scoreboard in the background there. :P', '2006-07-31 05:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678587, 367808, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, Kryta ... NICE job! I am the person who gave you a 10 on this and you know what? It was the only 10 I gave in the whole challenge! I gave lots of nines, but only one 10. Cool, since I see from your profile that that is how old you are. Hope you keep up with photography because you''re really good! The most important thing is that you enjoy it, but it looks like you must''ve had fun with this shot. Yay for you! I''ll be looking for future challenge entries from you.</td>', 'Wow, Kryta ... NICE job! I am the person who gave you a 10 on this and you know what? It was the only 10 I gave in the whole challenge! I gave lots of nines, but only one 10. Cool, since I see from your profile that that is how old you are. Hope you keep up with photography because you''re really good! The most important thing is that you enjoy it, but it looks like you must''ve had fun with this shot. Yay for you! I''ll be looking for future challenge entries from you.', '2006-07-31 05:44:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678589, 368188, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats. This shot immediately reminded me of grigrigirl''s  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=220146" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Evolve</a>, both of which has a sort of inner soul quality to it, if that makes any sense.</td>', 'Congrats. This shot immediately reminded me of grigrigirl''s  Evolve, both of which has a sort of inner soul quality to it, if that makes any sense.', '2006-07-31 05:45:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2678593, 367438, 45003, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot everybody for the comments and your votes! I''m very happy with this placing, it''s my best so far. <br/> <br/>@Hotpasta: Thanks, but I don''t feel robbed. 13 Out of 296 is something I''m very happy with.</td>', 'Thanks a lot everybody for the comments and your votes! I''m very happy with this placing, it''s my best so far.  @Hotpasta: Thanks, but I don''t feel robbed. 13 Out of 296 is something I''m very happy with.', '2006-07-31 05:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
