(2678615, 368706, 43434, '<td valign="top">I thought this as a concept was great .. I gave it a seven ... there are minor issues around the other colours being slightly overpowering, the gold egg being centred etc ... so I minused out for those :)</td>', 'I thought this as a concept was great .. I gave it a seven ... there are minor issues around the other colours being slightly overpowering, the gold egg being centred etc ... so I minused out for those :)', '2006-07-31 05:58:36.000000', NULL, 0),
