(2679096, 367005, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice Jimmy!  I like the water on the subject - nice for the effect.  Composition is great.  Lighting is very well done - the balance of shadow and highlight is perfect.  Angle of placement really adds to the appearance.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice Jimmy!  I like the water on the subject - nice for the effect.  Composition is great.  Lighting is very well done - the balance of shadow and highlight is perfect.  Angle of placement really adds to the appearance.  Well done!', '2006-07-31 08:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2679119, 368380, 50034, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I didn''t see even one comment about the Bride of Frankenstein sporting the latest trends (ala Gold Buttons.)  Guess I had to do it!  Man!  You do have a singular skill because you lit the "staples" so well that I thought, <b>"Those are real!</b>  She must be into the goth lifestyle!  She''s tougher than I am!  I couldn''t take the pain!"<br/>   Then I read your explanation &amp; thought, <i>"Dude, you are such a sophomore!  The upper ''stitches'' would have proved fatal!"</i> <br/> <b>The Bottom Line is that you are a GREAT photographer when you can create "REAL" from faux!  Nice job!</b>  :)</td>', 'Wow!  I didn''t see even one comment about the Bride of Frankenstein sporting the latest trends (ala Gold Buttons.)  Guess I had to do it!  Man!  You do have a singular skill because you lit the "staples" so well that I thought, "Those are real!  She must be into the goth lifestyle!  She''s tougher than I am!  I couldn''t take the pain!"   Then I read your explanation & thought, "Dude, you are such a sophomore!  The upper ''stitches'' would have proved fatal!"  The Bottom Line is that you are a GREAT photographer when you can create "REAL" from faux!  Nice job!  :)', '2006-07-31 08:59:20.000000', NULL, 0),
