(2680557, 367767, 17851, '<td valign="top">this definetly has gold, but I think the voters needed more impact. I think if you would have showed the face of the person playing the gold instrument with a good angle, it could have created more response from the viewer. Another thing that could work is to desaturate everything but the drum and hands, that way the things around it become less distracting. Hope I helped? ;)</td>', 'this definetly has gold, but I think the voters needed more impact. I think if you would have showed the face of the person playing the gold instrument with a good angle, it could have created more response from the viewer. Another thing that could work is to desaturate everything but the drum and hands, that way the things around it become less distracting. Hope I helped? ;)', '2006-07-31 15:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2680560, 368246, 55642, '<td valign="top">Kinda amusing that just about all of us from Denver headed straight for the Capitol, and that a fellow Denverite took the blue with something completely different... heh... anyway, I like your shot a lot, very rich in color. The sky cooperated for you a lot more than it did for me. We were there the same day, but yours looks a bit later than mine. I was hoping to recreate a shot now in my portfolio, but luck was not on my side. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-31 14:54:17.</i></td>', 'Kinda amusing that just about all of us from Denver headed straight for the Capitol, and that a fellow Denverite took the blue with something completely different... heh... anyway, I like your shot a lot, very rich in color. The sky cooperated for you a lot more than it did for me. We were there the same day, but yours looks a bit later than mine. I was hoping to recreate a shot now in my portfolio, but luck was not on my side. ', '2006-07-31 15:53:27.000000', '2006-07-31 15:54:17.000000', 0),
