(2680676, 366779, 40718, '<td valign="top">The processing artifact around the petals was likely a big downer.  You need a shot without flaws to score 6.0.  Above that it''s a combination of taste and "wow" and how the voters saw those two qualities.</td>', 'The processing artifact around the petals was likely a big downer.  You need a shot without flaws to score 6.0.  Above that it''s a combination of taste and "wow" and how the voters saw those two qualities.', '2006-07-31 16:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2680691, 367767, 10720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by elsapo:</b></div><hr/><i> this definetly has gold, but I think the voters needed more impact. I think if you would have showed the face of the person playing the gold instrument with a good angle, it could have created more response from the viewer. Another thing that could work is to desaturate everything but the drum and hands, that way the things around it become less distracting. Hope I helped? ;) </i></td></tr></table> Thanks I appeciate the help! Two very good ideas.</td>', 'Originally posted by elsapo: this definetly has gold, but I think the voters needed more impact. I think if you would have showed the face of the person playing the gold instrument with a good angle, it could have created more response from the viewer. Another thing that could work is to desaturate everything but the drum and hands, that way the things around it become less distracting. Hope I helped? ;)  Thanks I appeciate the help! Two very good ideas.', '2006-07-31 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
