(2680720, 366516, 17507, '<td valign="top">now that the challenge is over and I can see whose image this is, I can be sure that your choice to make the image 550 pixels tall (instead of 640) was a deliberate choice rather than the oversight of one unfamiliar with the customs of DPC. from that standpoint, I still wonder why you chose the smaller size. Was the image just too information-heavy to keep at the full 640?</td>', 'now that the challenge is over and I can see whose image this is, I can be sure that your choice to make the image 550 pixels tall (instead of 640) was a deliberate choice rather than the oversight of one unfamiliar with the customs of DPC. from that standpoint, I still wonder why you chose the smaller size. Was the image just too information-heavy to keep at the full 640?', '2006-07-31 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
