(2681576, 368596, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>Not one of your best, but kudos to your daughter for being a good sport about it!  Kinda looks more fake-tannish than gold, and you lose the hair in the background.  She really is a very pretty model, though!</td>', 'Trading Post comment Not one of your best, but kudos to your daughter for being a good sport about it!  Kinda looks more fake-tannish than gold, and you lose the hair in the background.  She really is a very pretty model, though!', '2006-07-31 20:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2681581, 368652, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>I quite liked this one, and thought it fit the challenge very well.  Title was a little long.  :-)  I think you caught the light well and the angle is good.  Would make a good shot for a tourist brochure.</td>', 'Trading Post comment I quite liked this one, and thought it fit the challenge very well.  Title was a little long.  :-)  I think you caught the light well and the angle is good.  Would make a good shot for a tourist brochure.', '2006-07-31 20:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
