(2691474, 368525, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Great abstract. I wouldn''t know what the reflection is of without the explanation. The gold colors are very good. The only detraction is the red lines right in the middle. I can''t figure out if they are also part of the reflection or something in the water. But, if you could get rid of them it would be so much better.</td>', 'Trading post...  Great abstract. I wouldn''t know what the reflection is of without the explanation. The gold colors are very good. The only detraction is the red lines right in the middle. I can''t figure out if they are also part of the reflection or something in the water. But, if you could get rid of them it would be so much better.', '2006-08-03 09:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2691499, 368652, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Nice job on this one. I especially like the glow in the eyes and on the chin. Maybe you could heal out on the cheek though. It''s gives it a mystical quality. Your gold tones are very nice.</td>', 'Trading post...   Nice job on this one. I especially like the glow in the eyes and on the chin. Maybe you could heal out on the cheek though. It''s gives it a mystical quality. Your gold tones are very nice.', '2006-08-03 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2691521, 365769, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Met the challenge very well. And it would be an excellent product advertisement. Not that it did bad here, but it seems most voters don''t like ad like photos. If you do it well the best your going to get is low 5''s. (Don''t get me wrong I''d be happy to get low 5''s!). But maybe if you had opened the bottle and had a pretty glass full next to it, it would have done better.</td>', 'Trading post...   Met the challenge very well. And it would be an excellent product advertisement. Not that it did bad here, but it seems most voters don''t like ad like photos. If you do it well the best your going to get is low 5''s. (Don''t get me wrong I''d be happy to get low 5''s!). But maybe if you had opened the bottle and had a pretty glass full next to it, it would have done better.', '2006-08-03 10:06:21.000000', NULL, 0),
