(2698087, 368227, 29168, '<td valign="top">The composition is excellent in my view. The crystal clarity, lighting and super-sharp focus diligently capture something very real. Rather than abstracting human flesh, this shot celebrates the natural form in pristine detail. I love it.<br/> <br/>I think the photo deserved a much higher placing in the challenge than it got. I guess socially/culturally biased, subjective criticism was involved yet again. "There''s no accounting for the voters" :)<br/></td>', 'The composition is excellent in my view. The crystal clarity, lighting and super-sharp focus diligently capture something very real. Rather than abstracting human flesh, this shot celebrates the natural form in pristine detail. I love it. I think the photo deserved a much higher placing in the challenge than it got. I guess socially/culturally biased, subjective criticism was involved yet again. "There''s no accounting for the voters" :)', '2006-08-05 22:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
