(2705403, 368438, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ionyou:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TooCool:</b></div><hr/><i> Is the film really that color?  This is quite cool!<br/>TC </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe he painted it, maybe it''s Maybeline. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, that''s right, I painted the film with gold spray.<br/> <br/>Many thanks everyone for helpful comments and votes - much appreciated!</td>', 'Originally posted by ionyou: Originally posted by TooCool: Is the film really that color?  This is quite cool!TC   Maybe he painted it, maybe it''s Maybeline.   Yes, that''s right, I painted the film with gold spray. Many thanks everyone for helpful comments and votes - much appreciated!', '2006-08-08 07:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
