(2771106, 367470, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture.  Great colors in your dof. I''ve been snapping these guys on the buddleia and find the variability in their coloring interesting... the amount of blue or shade of yellow, etc.  That this didn''t do better is evidence of the current butterfly backlash.  Or, as I heard mentioned on The Simpsons, the Farfalle Vendetta ;-)</td>', 'Lovely capture.  Great colors in your dof. I''ve been snapping these guys on the buddleia and find the variability in their coloring interesting... the amount of blue or shade of yellow, etc.  That this didn''t do better is evidence of the current butterfly backlash.  Or, as I heard mentioned on The Simpsons, the Farfalle Vendetta ;-)', '2006-08-29 18:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
