(2874740, 366779, 118503, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i> The processing artifact around the petals was likely a big downer.  You need a shot without flaws to score 6.0.  Above that it''s a combination of taste and "wow" and how the voters saw those two qualities. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There are no processing artifacts around the petals - thats called DOF.</td>', 'Originally posted by DrAchoo: The processing artifact around the petals was likely a big downer.  You need a shot without flaws to score 6.0.  Above that it''s a combination of taste and "wow" and how the voters saw those two qualities.   There are no processing artifacts around the petals - thats called DOF.', '2006-09-29 02:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
