(2894649, 368702, 18722, '<td valign="top">For the record -- No, you do not need to cut it.  There, got that off my chest. :D<br/> <br/>I realize you were shooting for a close-up to show focus on the texture and color, but I have to agree with your original idea.  The first thing I thought of when I saw the picture was ''Beautiful hair'', but then I was following the line of the strands down out of the frame.  Like I said, I agree with your original idea; including all of your hair in the shot would have been great.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'For the record -- No, you do not need to cut it.  There, got that off my chest. :D I realize you were shooting for a close-up to show focus on the texture and color, but I have to agree with your original idea.  The first thing I thought of when I saw the picture was ''Beautiful hair'', but then I was following the line of the strands down out of the frame.  Like I said, I agree with your original idea; including all of your hair in the shot would have been great. David', '2006-10-04 07:36:09.000000', NULL, 0),
